-- Thebes template · Classic (Trivia). The Thebes look: navy field, lavender and purple, Libre Baskerville and Inter.
-- Slots ($…) are filled by the app. $questions is "kept by the server" for published contests.
Let the questions be $questions.
Let the time be $time s.
Let the series be $series.
Let ink be $ink.
Let field be $field.
Let accent be $accent.
Let sponsor be $sponsor.
Let card be $card.

Let there be a flat canvas called $id, 1080 by 1920.
Set the bench to $field.
Let text be in Inter bold, size 40.

-- the field
Let there be a rectangle called field, 1080 by 1920, at 540 960.
Make the field field.

-- the sponsor
Write "PRESENTED BY" called presented, size 22, tracking 8, at 540 120.
Make the presented accent.
Write $brand called brand in Libre Baskerville bold, size 76, at 540 200.
Make the brand sponsor.
Let there be a rectangle called rule, 860 by 3, at 540 268.
Make the rule accent.

-- the title
Write $title called title in Libre Baskerville bold, size 64, at 540 352.
Make the title white.
Write $subtitle called subtitle, size 24, tracking 6, under the title, 18 apart.
Make the subtitle accent.

-- the readouts
Let there be a rectangle called time-box, 400 by 92, corners 46, at 320 530.
Let there be a rectangle called score-box, 400 by 92, corners 46, at 760 530.
Make the time-box and the score-box card.
Write "TIME" called time-label, size 18, tracking 6, above the time-box, 12 apart.
Write "SCORE" called score-label, size 18, tracking 6, above the score-box, 12 apart.
Make the time-label and the score-label accent.

-- the board
Let there be a rectangle called board, 920 by 1180, corners 40, at 540 1196.
Make the board card.
Let there be a rectangle called stage, 880 by 1140, at 540 1196.

-- the game
Play trivia on the stage.
Every question is ink, with white letters, in Libre Baskerville, corners 24.
Every answer is white, with ink letters, in Inter, raised, outlined in ink, 3 wide, corners 18.
A chosen answer is accent.
A correct answer is #14a86a, with white letters.
A wrong answer is #e5484d, with white letters.
Every readout is ink, in Inter.
An urgent readout is #e5484d.
Show the timer on the time-box.
Show the score on the score-box.
When the game is won, say $win.
When the game is lost, say $lose.
When the time runs out, say $timeout.
